#HELPS

0 ELEMSKILL ELEMENTALTRAINING~
Syntax: elemskill [element]
        elemskill <element> improve
        elemskill <element> focus
        elemskill remove focus
The eight tracks are fire, water, wind, earth, sun, moon, time, infinity.
Training costs 10 times the next rank in primal and normally caps at 8.
After all eight reach 8, a focus raises its element to 10 and lowers
the opposite to 6. Remove focus before changing it or training further.
Removing focus restores the native 10/6 track values to 8.
This is not the Phoenix parent's or Werewolf ELEMENTAL command.
~

0 FLAREARROW FIREBLADE PHOENIXFORM ELEMENTALFIRE~
Elemental Fire commands:
  1 FLAREARROW <target>: flaming attack, costing 100 + 50 times Fire
    in mana.
  8 FIREBLADE: native weapon-flame toggle, costing 2000 mana.
 10 PHOENIXFORM: native Phoenix-shaped combat form, costing 5000
    mana to activate.
Phoenix Form does not enroll you into the standalone Phoenix parent
or grant that parent's complete ability kit.
~

0 ICICLESTORM WATERTRAVEL AQUABARRIER WATERCONTROL ELEMENTALWATER~
Elemental Water commands:
  1 ICICLESTORM <target>: native ice attack, requiring 150 times
    Water in mana.
  5 WATERTRAVEL <target>: relocates the caster for 1500 mana.
  8 AQUABARRIER: native water-barrier toggle, requiring 2500 mana.
 10 WATERCONTROL <target>: attempts native interruption for 4000 mana.
Water Travel requires an eligible target elsewhere. Players must allow
summoning. Both rooms must permit travel; combat, restraint, roots,
curses/webs and incompatible planes block the journey.
Water Travel and Aqua Barrier were reversed in older overview help.
~

0 WINDWINGS WINDBLADES ATONINGWINDS ELEMENTALWIND~
Elemental Wind commands:
  1 WINDWINGS: native flight toggle.
  8 WINDBLADES <target>: wind attack, costing 100 times Wind in mana.
 10 ATONINGWINDS <target>: attempts the native slowing effect,
    requiring 600 times Wind in mana.
Flight is a real movement/combat flag, not permanent membership in a
winged class. Native safety and resistance checks still apply.
~

0 LOCALQUAKE STONEBLAST LIQUIFYEARTH ELEMENTALEARTH~
Elemental Earth commands:
  1 LOCALQUAKE: native room earthquake attack.
  8 STONEBLAST: room stone attack, costing 350 times Earth in mana.
 10 LIQUIFYEARTH <target>: attempts the native earth-control debuff,
    requiring 800 times Earth in mana.
Local Quake costs Earth times (20 minus Earth) times 30 mana.
Area effects retain their own native eligible-target checks.
~

0 SUNBATH HOLYAURA SOLARFLASH SOLARLIGHT ELEMENTALSUN~
Elemental Sun commands:
  3 SUNBATH <target>: native healing light for 800 mana.
  5 HOLYAURA: native holy-aura toggle, costing 500 times Sun in mana.
  8 SOLARFLASH <target>: attempts blindness for 250 times Sun in mana.
 10 SOLARLIGHT: native sunshield toggle, requiring 600 times Sun in mana.
Sun Bath requires 3, not the rank 1 in older overview help.
These item-affect toggles are not permanent changes to base attributes.
~

0 MIRAGESLICE NIGHTBLADE SPIRALMOON ELEMENTALMOON~
Elemental Moon commands:
  3 MIRAGESLICE <target>: native illusion attack, costing 100 times
    Moon in mana.
  8 NIGHTBLADE <target>: native double/life-stealing attack, costing
    450 times Moon in mana.
 10 SPIRALMOON <target>: attempts the native dark weakening effect,
    requiring 5500 mana.
Mirage Slice requires 3, not the rank 1 in older overview help.
These attacks retain their native combat and resistance checks.
~

0 FARSIGHT CLOAKOFSIGHT INFINITESIGHT ULTIMAWAVE ELEMENTALINFINITY~
Elemental Infinity commands:
  2 FARSIGHT <target>: looks at an eligible distant location without
    granting arbitrary permanent teleportation.
  3 CLOAKOFSIGHT: toggles the native remote-sight concealment.
  5 INFINITESIGHT: toggles native enhanced sight.
 10 ULTIMAWAVE: native room destruction wave. Requires at least 10000
    mana and spends all current mana, not merely a flat 10000.
Far Sight requires 2, not the rank 1 in older overview help.
~

0 SLOW ELEMENTALTIME~
Syntax: slow <target>
Requires Elemental Time 10 and 800 times Time in mana.
Attempts the native slowing debuff with its existing target, resistance
and duplicate checks. It is not a permanent reduction of base stats.
Related: ELEMSKILL, ATONINGWINDS, ALTERWEIGHT.
~

0 ELEMARMOR ELEMENTALEQUIPMENT~
Syntax: elemarmor <bracer|sword>
Creates the selected native Elemental class item for 400 quest points
and 100 primal. The object template must exist.
It is ordinary class equipment, not an ascension artifact reward.
Related: ELEMENTAL, ELEMSKILL.
~

